This is decision-dense and ready to append as the "B1 Resolution (post-W3-audit)" section. I did not write it to disk — per your instruction, I'm returning it as text for adversarial spec review before any implementation. The one open item I'd flag for that review: the §5-item-2 note about whether `claim_discriminates`/`claim_isolates` are themselves silently NULL-on-ingest in the current compact INSERT (lines 625-674 omit them from the column list) — if true, that is a pre-existing sibling bug to `parity_run_type` and the reviewer should decide whether to fold it into this remediation or split it.
